      "writtenOn": "2013-07-22T20:39:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does it make sense to store the key (sig and enc) as a single value and do the slices every time?  \n\nI\u0027m inclined to think that it would make more sense to make sig and enc as two separate elements that the driver returns from .get_shared_key().\n\nThis doesn\u0027t really need to change, just thinking about options / approach",
